      "text": "I know how some things sound so incredulous that it's hard to believe them.\n\nHere's the list of my near-death experiences:\n\nNearly Losing Your Right Foot\nVolcanic Eruption\nTyphoon\nDysentery\nCombined Philippines Event (Volcano + Typhoon + Dysentery)\nInside a Tornado\nSevere Fall\nC. difficile Infection\nMultiple Assaults (Military, Off-Base, Abusive Ex)\nNearly Being Run Over by My Abusive Ex\nNearly a Half Dozen Times She Held a Knife Against Me\nSelf-Harm Thoughts\nMotor Vehicle Accident\nFires\nTornado (separate)\nDespair\nMilitary Incident\n\nThe rarity of all 17 of these events occurring to just one person is astronomical.\n\nI choose to live EVERY day.\n\nI am blessed. I am unique. I am 1 in trillions upon trillions.\n\nGuess what... If I survived all this, you can survive what you've been through. You just cannot ever give up. Keep moving forward. And don't ever stop.",
